For 8 turns you gain the mass and power of a star, drawing all creatures within radius 5 toward you and dealing [16, 23, 33, 44, 55 (STR 10-100)] fire, [16, 23, 33, 44, 55 (STR 10-100)] light and [16, 23, 33, 44, 55 (STR 10-100)] physical damage to all foes and reducing their damage dealt by 30%.

Foes closer to you take up to 150% damage.

The damage will increase with your Strength.
